Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黛安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:18.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:27.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好箭法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妹妹有过一条那样的裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister had that dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:54.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越来越有条不紊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting to be like clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在吗  头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看上去少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你该再仔细看看  加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you might look again, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:21.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们履行了义务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've met our obligations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.35,0:01:33.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看上去不怎么多  但  八  九  十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't seem like much, but 8, 9, 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要他的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want his gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  我觉得就不该给这混蛋配枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I don't think this asshole should have a gun ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.43,0:01:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坏小子不许碰枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No guns for bad boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:50.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你先打的我  混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit me first, prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下该如何是好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.93,0:02:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:08.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下该如何是好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:17.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把武器给他  理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand him your weapon, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪  白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:36.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧  你个孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck on it, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard! ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结  你知道我不能容忍这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel, you know I can't have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们不能容忍这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:03:01.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查德将被禁止参与我们未来的会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard will refrain from attending our future exchanges.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  以西结  你得一直把他带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, Ezekiel, you're gonna keep bringing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:06.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为假如这种事继续发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if this doesn't stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如这发展成了一个真正的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this starts becoming a real problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:12.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得我说过什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you remember what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会是第一个被球棒砸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is still batting first on the lineup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己刚刚差点都忍不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost did it myself just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这不是他的错  但...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's not his fault, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:27.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能再发生这种事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this has got to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:29.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许以后得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}things might need to get a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:35.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,野蛮点\N{\fnArial\fs30}visceral.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞德  快他妈起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jared, get the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:41.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:47.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能不能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能不能要回我的棍子  麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have my stick back, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:54.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是别人给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:03:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这人已经去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:00.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加文  你得让我把这个傻逼狠揍一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin, you got to let me turn up this dipshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:02.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:04.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看下气氛好吗  大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}read the goddamn room, sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:11.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:41.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:45.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妹妹可爱那条裙子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister loved that dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今天使棍很灵敏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were quick with that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,令我刮目相看  本杰明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive, Benjamin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:04:59.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉过你  我进步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you I'm getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:01.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进步得有点太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a trifle too quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道如何打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you now know how to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不意味着你应该去找茬\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean you should seek one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:07.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生得太快  我没来得及考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it just happened. I wasn't thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.13,0:05:08.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从现在开始  你都要考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time from this time forward, so you shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:20.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍后我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall speak later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:26.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你棍子使得真霸气  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick with this stick, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:38.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去医务室吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, do you want to head to the infirmary?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:43.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你坐卡车去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you go in them trucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.81,0:05:47.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟达里尔单独谈谈  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to speak to Daryl alone. That okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你找点东西包扎伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll get you something for that cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去见救世军了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went to see them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:05:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,协议的一部分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:05.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没毛病吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:07.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:15.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你知道他们是什么东西  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what they are. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:23.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  如果卡萝尔在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if Carol were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:25.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she saw all that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她知道了亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she knew about Abraham...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和格伦的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Glenn...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会带我们去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'd be leading us right to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:36.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}ready to kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是她离开的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why she left, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.54,0:07:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得多用弓箭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna have to start using these more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.11,0:07:25.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军深知不该让我带枪在他们附近晃悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors are smart enough to know I shouldn't have a gun around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.25,0:07:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根说你是弩手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan said you're a bowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:48.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们的目标一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we want the same things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:55.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.07,0:08:46.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要一些事来打动以西结\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need something to move Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就是机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大  山顶寨和神之国先下手为强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexandria, the Hilltop, and the Kingdom hitting first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:05.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重创他们  然后从世上抹杀救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}hitting hard, and then we wipe the Saviors from the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping people...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:12.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多很多好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}dozens and dozens and dozens of good people...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(公墓)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们从这条路走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ride this road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有车路过  肯定是救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we see cars, it's the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:01.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近他们三五人一伙常来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been coming in packs of two or three lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:02.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:04.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人对付不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先用枪攻击他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna hit them with the guns first...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:09.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后用燃烧瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the Molotovs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再用枪  直到他们全灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then back to the guns until they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:15.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么用火  -要看起来惨烈点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why the fire? - Needs to look bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:18.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现尸骸的救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors who discover what's left...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要让他们震怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}we want them to be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我留了踪迹到我做的伪武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left a trail from here to the weapons cache I planted,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.99,0:10:28.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到以西结在乎的某人住的小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the cabin of that someone Ezekiel cares about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:30.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是他遇见的某个独行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just some loner he met.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:34.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候他会送食物过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes he brings food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:36.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么不住在神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't they live in the Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:37.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:39.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她住在外面  会死在外面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives out there, she'll die out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:43.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有什么关系  她比我们胆子还大\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that matter? She's got more balls than you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.11,0:10:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正她都要死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna die either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军来了发现他们的人死了以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Saviors come and find their buddies dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:55.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们不太蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they know their elbow from their asshole
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:57.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会追踪明显的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and can follow an obvious spoor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:11:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会去武器库  然后去小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're gonna go to the weapons cache and then to the cabin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会攻击这个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're gonna attack this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们会杀了她  也许杀不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they kill her, maybe they don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.61,0:11:11.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这会让以西结知道该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's gonna show Ezekiel what he needs to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她名字  叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:16.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很强  也许她能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's tough. Maybe she'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说他妈的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say her damn name!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:27.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望你不认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hoped you didn't know her,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:32.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不知道你会在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't think you'd care,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你知道必须做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you know what needs to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不行  -也许她能活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - ‭Maybe she'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:39.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this -- this is how --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is how this could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:42.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是除掉救世军的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we can get rid of the Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们都有未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}how we all can have a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她独自住在野外\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's living out there on her own,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.49,0:11:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只是在等死  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- just waiting to die. - ‭No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:51.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不做什么  会死更多的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't do anything, a hell of a lot more people are gonna die,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想活的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}people who want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我离卡萝尔远点  听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay the hell away from Carol, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:06.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:13.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以等着事情变糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can wait for things to go bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we lose people...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者我们可以咬牙做难事\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we can do the hard thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:23.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选择自己的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and choose our fate for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:24.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有更多人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:12:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or those --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.89,0:13:01.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过会儿会再从这条路回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're gonna ride back this way later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你和你的人想反抗救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you and your people want to move against the Saviors...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就得尽快下手  你们需要神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to do it soon, and you need the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要做的事总会有牺牲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we have to do requires sacrifice one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:26.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys like us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.23,0:13:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经失去了太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've already lost so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.55,0:13:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.35,0:13:34.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔  孤身在外生活...\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Carol, living on her own like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.64,0:13:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她现在可能已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she might as well be dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:49.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她受伤  她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gets hurt, she dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她染上风寒\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she catches a fever,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她被行尸杀了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she's taken out by a walker...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她被闪电劈中...\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she gets hit by lightning --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要她出了一点点事  我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything -- anything happens to her, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意为神之国而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would die for the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么不去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:55.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有没有领头的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a collective, or does one lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:16:59.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:13.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的命在我们手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We own your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:17.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想换回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want buy them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:20.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有什么好东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:23.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们抓了一个我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you have one of my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:25.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加百利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:28.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想先见见他  然后再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see him first. Then we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们拿走的船上的东西被别人夺走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boat things you took got taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们看到了  就拿走了剩下的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw them, so we took the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便把他也带了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就知道我们没有可以用来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you know we have nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:17.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交换我们性命的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to buy back our lives with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.57,0:18:22.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也即将一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you'll have soon -- nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:26.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我和我的人听命于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because me and my people already belong to that group
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:28.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那伙夺走船上物资的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who took those supplies from the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:30.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're called the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:32.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的命在他们手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They own our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.42,0:18:36.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you kill us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就等于夺走了他们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be taking something from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会来找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will come looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇上救世军  你只有两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only have two options when it comes to the Saviors --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:54.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被杀或者被他们所支配\N{\fnArial\fs30}either they kill you or they own you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:57.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过有一个出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.07,0:19:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:04.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加入我们  反抗他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join us in fighting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:14.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗西塔  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:37.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.33,0:19:45.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了我们  否则我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us go, or I will kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:50.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻放了塔米尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from Tamiel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军  他们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors, they --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还有其他地方  其他社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have other places, other communities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.81,0:20:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有各种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have things --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食物  武器  车  燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}food, weapons, vehicles, fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.80,0:20:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想要什么  救世军都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you want, the Saviors have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了塔米尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from Tamiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.45,0:20:40.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your words now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果加入我们  一起打倒他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you join us and we beat them together,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:51.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以获得很多他们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can have much of what's theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与我们一起战斗  你们少不了好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting with us, you'll be rewarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.34,0:20:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多到超乎你们的想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.42,0:20:59.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want something now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:04.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This group?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们来这里找到了我  离家那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found me -- here, so far from our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:15.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们  我们会帮你得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell us -- we'll get it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会向你们展现出我们的实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll show you what we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔米尔  布里昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamiel, Brion...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.69,0:21:38.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把瑞克带到"坡顶"\N{\fnArial\fs30}show Rick Up Up Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.33,0:21:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:09.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.37,0:22:10.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.09,0:22:17.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.93,0:22:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜  是你新交的好朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}New best friends, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.13,0:22:28.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要带瑞克去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they taking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.24,0:23:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们所有人  自灾变之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us, here since the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.08,0:23:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.09,0:23:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不费心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但情况变得越来越难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things grow harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.66,0:23:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我们打开罐头  发现里面已经腐坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We open cans, sometimes inside's rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:30.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日子一天天过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.50,0:23:33.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况又再次变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are changing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.74,0:23:36.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们也该变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe we change.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.61,0:23:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.16,0:23:45.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要知道你是不是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to know you're real with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:47.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你是否值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.27,0:23:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.27,0:24:16.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.51,0:24:23.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.94,0:24:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.01,0:25:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.35,0:25:59.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.33,0:26:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在相信我们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe us now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.43,0:26:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell us what you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.08,0:26:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们帮你弄来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.52,0:27:55.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.83,0:27:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.27,0:27:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.53,0:28:02.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到后我们会加入你的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we fight your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.82,0:28:22.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定我们会赢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we will win?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.22,0:28:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.22,0:28:28.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束后  我们要分一半的战利品\N{\fnArial\fs30}After, we get half of what's won.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.31,0:28:29.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你们三分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'll get a third.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.01,0:28:32.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且把之前从我们这偷的东西还回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're taking back what you just stole from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.90,0:28:36.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.80,0:28:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}A third.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:39.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.64,0:28:43.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}A third.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.24,0:28:47.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三分之一  但不归还我们偷的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A third, and we keep what we stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.95,0:28:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿走的罐头  还你们一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of the jars, the ones we took.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.87,0:28:57.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个提议我只说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One time, this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.23,0:28:59.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:03.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.93,0:29:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.33,0:29:10.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.04,0:29:13.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.53,0:29:25.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在那艘船边上等了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waited by the boat long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.33,0:29:27.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要点补偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want something for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.29,0:29:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.11,0:29:33.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罐头和枪  枪和罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jars and guns, guns and jars.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.89,0:29:38.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就是等着别人替你们从船上拿出物资吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You waited for someone to get the supplies off that boat for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.70,0:29:40.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等了很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.67,0:29:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只拿  不费心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take. We don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.25,0:29:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面那个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had that...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.82,0:29:51.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个东西就是让别人证明自己的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}thing down there for someone to prove themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.13,0:29:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.42,0:29:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫温斯洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Winslow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.75,0:30:02.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想对加百利做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you gonna do with Gabriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.75,0:30:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.13,0:30:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,协议是有期限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal expires.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.32,0:30:09.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快过期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.54,0:30:14.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.95,0:30:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jadis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.01,0:31:00.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达成协议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.81,0:31:39.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和理查德说了不要再来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told Richard no more visits.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.03,0:31:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.64,0:31:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你渴望独处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your desire is solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.29,0:31:45.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这样下令的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I've ordered to be facilitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:48.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人是来清理行尸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men are here clearing the wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.64,0:31:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸向来都不顾他人是否想独处\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead are quite inconsiderate when it comes to those who are wanting to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.67,0:31:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们轻手轻脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought our efforts would be quiet enough
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.06,0:31:56.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会引起你的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fall beneath your notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.62,0:31:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你打开了门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who opened the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.95,0:32:01.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的警戒线被碰到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tripped my wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.65,0:32:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我及时抓住它了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I caught it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.36,0:32:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.45,0:32:05.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您把它们藏得很好  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hid them well, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.69,0:32:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要叫她女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call her "Lady."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.52,0:32:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人  小姐  太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, Ms, Missus...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.77,0:32:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以闭嘴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can shut up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.58,0:32:11.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.04,0:32:14.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.12,0:32:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.28,0:32:22.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水果馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cobbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.82,0:32:27.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文说你喜欢吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin said you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:28.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是以备你开门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case you did open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.15,0:32:38.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.91,0:33:37.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.90,0:33:45.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣带我们来了神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus took us to the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.15,0:33:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根说你离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan said you just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.43,0:33:52.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在外面的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.98,0:33:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.50,0:34:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.28,0:34:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.68,0:34:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我站岗的时候听到了动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard something when I was on watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.88,0:34:33.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是从墙里面传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from inside the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.14,0:34:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去储藏室查看  有个人偷袭了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went into the pantry, one of them jumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.12,0:34:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很生气  因为他们等了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was angry because she didn't get the supplies from the boat
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.35,0:34:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后也没得到船上的物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.15,0:34:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们逼我把余下东西装好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they made me pack up everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.60,0:34:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她说他们在船附近  所以我希望...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she said they were at the boat, so I hoped...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.29,0:34:51.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不只是希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You didn't just hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.29,0:34:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我们带到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.03,0:34:59.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经开始要失去信心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was beginning to lose faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.54,0:35:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我看到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.59,0:35:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你向我点头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you nodded at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.68,0:35:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我没有离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, just the fact that you knew I didn't leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.17,0:35:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搜寻后找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you searched and found me,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.53,0:35:14.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you, seeing these numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.64,0:35:15.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很...\N{\fnArial\fs30}you seemed so...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.07,0:35:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.67,0:35:23.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会纠正这一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.73,0:35:27.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是在这以前境况会非常困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}But things are gonna get very hard before that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.05,0:35:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.81,0:35:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.34,0:35:35.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.60,0:35:45.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.11,0:35:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么让你这么自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you so... confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.44,0:35:57.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人向我展示了敌人也可以变为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone showed me enemies can become friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.90,0:36:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不应该回亚历山大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't be going back to Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.45,0:36:13.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得留在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to stay out
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.34,0:36:14.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为协议找枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and look for the guns for this deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.47,0:36:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克受伤了  亚伦受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick is hurt. Aaron is hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.68,0:36:20.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我更担心埃里克看到我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more nervous about what Eric will say
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.26,0:36:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又成这样会怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he sees my face like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.16,0:36:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家里的人需要食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}People back home need food.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.41,0:36:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克想带回补给  然后重整旗鼓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick wants to bring supplies back and we regroup,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.51,0:36:29.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that's what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.41,0:36:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll go on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:39.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要待在一起  就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are sticking together, and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.14,0:36:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.05,0:36:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在不是要挑起争端  罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not looking for a fight right now, Rosita!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.53,0:36:48.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在为战斗做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting ready for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.18,0:36:50.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战斗时刻都有  塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always a fight, Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.81,0:36:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让任何人挡我们的路或拖后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting anyone get in our way or slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.01,0:36:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止别人掠夺我们也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we got to stop people from taking from us
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.07,0:36:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从别人那里抢也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we got to take from other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.32,0:37:00.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.73,0:37:02.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We win.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.93,0:37:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成熟点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.16,0:37:10.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.85,0:37:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.86,0:37:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  要么免谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon. Or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.52,0:37:22.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们帮你缝好针后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we get you stitched up,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.77,0:37:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上回去找枪  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll go right back out and find the guns, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.03,0:37:26.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.75,0:37:28.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道去哪找吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea where?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.17,0:37:31.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  但是这从没阻止过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but that's never stopped us before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.76,0:37:35.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉  你在外面比我们走得都远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, you've been out further than any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.17,0:37:38.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少你能告诉我们别去哪找\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you can tell us where not to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.04,0:37:40.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.10,0:37:42.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.72,0:37:44.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.30,0:37:46.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold -- Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.00,0:37:57.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you...? ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.22,0:38:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we won.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.94,0:38:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代替你失去的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to replace the one you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.66,0:38:09.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.35,0:38:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.34,0:38:25.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能失去任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't lose anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.60,0:38:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能失去任何一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't lose any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.42,0:38:36.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.92,0:38:45.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.48,0:38:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.24,0:38:54.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.83,0:38:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们伤害我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they hurt any of our people --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.69,0:39:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤害更多的人  我就会这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}any more of them -- that's what I would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.72,0:39:10.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那之后我将不再是以前的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there wouldn't be anything left of me after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.80,0:39:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军  他们来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors -- did they come?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.18,0:39:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.01,0:39:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人受伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anyone get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.05,0:39:54.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.89,0:40:01.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军有没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the Saviors...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.89,0:40:13.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家里的大家还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everybody back home okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.19,0:40:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.42,0:40:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.13,0:40:34.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们杀光了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.80,0:40:40.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟剩下的敌人达成了协议  就像以西结一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made a deal with the rest of them, like Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.29,0:40:43.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.69,0:40:47.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.34,0:40:59.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还吃不吃饭了  我得是个国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna eat or -- or I got to be a king or something
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.11,0:41:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能在这吃饭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get food around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.81,0:41:05.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.77,0:41:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.38,0:41:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他人好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.43,0:41:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.35,0:42:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己保重  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out for yourself, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.89,0:42:58.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它对你很温驯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're good with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.83,0:43:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以西结会印象深刻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel will be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.39,0:43:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想养老虎当宠物的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, figure any guy that has a pet tiger
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.77,0:43:09.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会坏到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't be that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.01,0:43:13.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔觉得他挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's okay by Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.33,0:43:16.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到她了  在外面那座小屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I found her, out in that little house.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.43,0:43:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, what I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.09,0:43:23.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说她\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I said she just...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.14,0:43:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}went away...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.65,0:43:30.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她让我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's what she told me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.58,0:43:31.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.38,0:43:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要神之国\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.47,0:43:40.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要促成合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.20,0:43:45.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.48,0:43:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I -- I really am, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.23,0:43:54.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can't be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.38,0:44:01.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你所坚持的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, whatever it is you're holding on to...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.98,0:44:05.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's already gone, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.78,0:44:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.23,0:44:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我一样  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the same as me, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.87,0:44:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我毫不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know shit about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.20,0:44:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.31,0:44:24.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你没告诉卡萝尔发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you didn't tell Carol what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.42,0:44:29.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有  不然她会来这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't, 'cause she'd be here otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.67,0:44:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对此很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm glad for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.74,0:44:38.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在坚持着一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we're all holding on to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.96,0:44:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早上回山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back to Hilltop in the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.33,0:44:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}and getting ready.
